{
  "name": "Social Media Auto-Poster (Twitter_X + Instagram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP (10 min)\n\n1. **Google Sheets**: create a 'Content Calendar' sheet with columns: Date (yyyy-MM-dd) | Caption | Image URL | Posted. Connect your Google credentials in 'Read Content Calendar'.\n2. **X (Twitter)**: connect your account in 'Post to X'.\n3. **Instagram**: connect a Facebook Graph API credential (linked to your Instagram Business account) in both 'Create IG Media Container' and 'Publish IG Media'. Set the Instagram Business Account ID as a Set node value if you extend this workflow.\n4. This checks the calendar every morning and posts any row scheduled for today that isn't already marked Posted. For platforms without a native n8n node (e.g. Pinterest, TikTok), duplicate the HTTP Request pattern used here or connect via a third-party bridge like Buffer/Zapier.\n\nThen activate the workflow (top-right toggle).",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "4878ffba-8035-4524-ae9e-7e8e355fcfd6",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "88fcb07c-e6f9-49f1-b458-28d9f8f42221",
      "name": "Every Morning at 9am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e24c79e6-5045-4753-ae1a-94426e916bc2",
      "name": "Read Content Calendar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        640,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const today = $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd');\nconst due = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const row = item.json;\n  const posted = String(row.Posted || '').trim().toLowerCase();\n  if (posted === 'yes' || posted === 'true') continue;\n  if (String(row.Date || '').trim() === today) due.push(item);\n}\nreturn due;"
      },
      "id": "b315e588-0b45-4ed1-a123-882d465a36e7",
      "name": "Find Today's Unposted Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "07bb0fe1-c230-4da3-aea6-a7fca35b279c",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Caption }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ed389342-962f-459c-b15f-e0406f392932",
      "name": "Has a Post Due Today?",
